<p>The <a href="https://www.arrl.org/">ARRL</a> describes Public Service as
"Amateur Radio operators [volunteering to] help their communities in good times
and bad, through community events, disaster response, and various programs."
This page presents a calendar of amateur radio volunteer service opportunities.
Volunteering is a great way to give back to the community, meet other radio
amateurs, and see parts of the area you may not have seen before.</p>

<p>In addition to the schedule below, which is for 12 months starting at the
current mouth, we also maintain <a href="/events/archive/">an archive of all
past events</a>.</p>

<h2>Schedule</h2>

<a class="noprint cal-subscribe" href="/events.ics">Add to calendar</a>

{% assign schedule = collections.event | eventsByMonth %}
{% for month in schedule %}

<h3>{{ month.name }} {{ month.year }}</h3>
{% if month.events.size == 0 %}
<p>No events this month.</p>
{% else %}
<ul>
{% for item in month.events %}
<li><span{% if item.isPast %} class="event-past"{% endif %}>{{
    item.event.data.schedule | formatEventDate }} - <a href="{{ item.event.url
      }}">{{ item.event.data.title }}</a></span></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
